This code initializes the SPI bus, ADC channel, GPIO lines, and logs. It continuously polls the sensor, checks if the measured distance is below 20 cm, and energizes the relay if so. A 1 s debounce delay is enforced before further detection. The program logs each detection event with a timestamp to a file named `door_events.log`.

The code also handles errors for all GPIO, SPI, and file I/O operations, correctly handles cases where the sensor is absent or the bus reports errors, and ensures that all resources are cleanly released on every exit path, including handling a SIGINT signal.

