This program initializes the GPIO driver, sets up the PIR sensor on GPIO17, and handles errors accordingly. It debounces motion detection, captures JPEG images, and uploads them to the specified HTTP endpoint. The program also creates the `motion_captures` directory if it doesn't exist.

The program uses Boost.Asio for the HTTP requests, so you'll need to link against the Boost libraries.

