This code initializes the I2C bus and GPIO pins, reads temperature and humidity from the SHTC3 sensor, calculates the CRC, validates the measurement, logs valid results to a file, and prints valid readings to stdout. It also handles errors, such as I2C write/read errors, CRC failures, out-of-range values, and file-open errors. The program exits cleanly when receiving a SIGINT.

