To compile the code, install the `libgpiod-dev` package and run:

```sh
gcc -o grow_light_controller grow_light_controller.c -lgpiod -lrt
```

The program will run continuously, logging lux readings to `grow_log.txt` and controlling the grow-light relay based on the lux readings. On receiving SIGINT or SIGTERM, it will cleanly release all resources and exit.

