This code initializes the I2C bus, opens the BH1750 sensor, requests the GPIO23 line, and sets up a callback to log relay state changes. It then enters an infinite loop where it reads the lux value, turns on the grow lamp if the lux value is below 150, and logs the lux value and relay state. If an error occurs during I2C communication, it logs the error and continues operation. The program runs indefinitely until a SIGINT is received, at which point it releases the resources and terminates.

