This code initializes the GPIO pins for the Keywish 3-Way Tracking Sensor, sets up a main loop that reads the sensor values and logs them to the console, and sends "EMERGENCY STOP!" over UART when all sensors read 0. It also handles errors gracefully and releases resources on exit paths. Signal handlers for SIGINT and SIGTERM are set up to close the UART port and release the GPIO resources before exiting.
